  "$id": "urn:jash:mem:v1",
  "title": "Native memory inference, actual stored cards, and publication receipts",
  "description": "Leading --json or --data/--data-v2. Shared deterministic engine, bounded previews and explicit excluded self-records. Source parsing and replayed references do not establish cryptographic verification or causal truth. Store metadata is from before the operation; applied/durable describe observed publication phases. attestation_requested records invocation only, not verified chain persistence. Truncated indicates requested page continuation. DATA has explicit resource limits and bypasses presentation budget.",
